{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"fba8ab0c51c01e7f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **ITEM** \n**A burned brand**\n\n---\nOn the body of a dead man entwined with black roots, an unusual brand was found. Its symbol seems familiar.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":-64,
			"y":4877,
			"width":520,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"ade90cb75bbe9975",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Ill mother**\nLies in a tent nearby and cannot move from her place",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-783,
			"y":4953,
			"width":481,
			"height":182
		},
		{
			"id":"f1ca05c5e6a82c6e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Father’s song**\nShe’s humming her father’s song ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-784,
			"y":5155,
			"width":481,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"7863f813b78d55c1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Power of the Stupa record**\nFound a record about the release of fire energy through the spine of the stupa.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":2416,
			"y":4165,
			"width":520,
			"height":195
		},
		{
			"id":"d562873003900acb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Revelation** \n\nThe pact is a text copy of the song Lhamo was taught by her father ",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":2416,
			"y":4833,
			"width":520,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"1045f05db551c24e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Olive oil**\nTo open a stupa have to buy Hellenistic non karma oil from the merchant",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":3176,
			"y":3793,
			"width":520,
			"height":195
		},
		{
			"id":"c4d98a1d44e7e70a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Srog-shing**\nThe protagonist got **Srog-shing** stick — the axis of the stupa, a catalyst for karma and fire",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":3176,
			"y":4165,
			"width":520,
			"height":195
		},
		{
			"id":"bbb87403c9d996c4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Artifact for trade**\nFound an artifact worthy of equivalent barter.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":2416,
			"y":3793,
			"width":520,
			"height":195
		},
		{
			"id":"8519dd5145b3081e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **The monastery’s background**\nRelates the monastery's backstory. \n\nThe First Lopon Lama chose this site for construction and created the architecture. Then made a pact with a Bon spirit. Tenzin knows no details. After the pact, a giant tree grew on the site of the Lopon Lama's house.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":696,
			"y":4950,
			"width":520,
			"height":351
		},
		{
			"id":"b5b20fc75cfda616",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Spirit pact**\nShe reveals the details of the pact between her ancestor and the spirit.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":1576,
			"y":4991,
			"width":520,
			"height":195
		},
		{
			"id":"957f88b46f961f31",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Fear and Desire**\nDreams of seeing the outside world and afraid of death, so she does not break the pact",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":1576,
			"y":5211,
			"width":520,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"229f02f0077557c5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Bon pact**\nThe text of the pact is recorded on the giant tree",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":1576,
			"y":5451,
			"width":520,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"586cacbc1205d89a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Monastery records**\nA clue to the correct sequence of the serpent columns.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":696,
			"y":5338,
			"width":520,
			"height":169
		},
		{
			"id":"6b9d748a8dc8c699",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Jinsreg Ritual**\nTenzin shares information on how to defeat the black roots by Jinsreg fire",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":696,
			"y":5557,
			"width":520,
			"height":210
		},
		{
			"id":"9b7a19785d7fbd3b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **«Обожженное тавро»** \n\n---\n\n_Ритуальный атрибут рода, который променял свои будущие перерождения на неподвижность камня. На обратной стороне выгравированы слова: «Мы — фундамент этого неба. Пока мы стоим, скалы молчат»._ _Лобсанг использовал его, чтобы метить скот, пытаясь превратить великий долг в обычное ремесло. Но корни прошлого невозможно скрыть сажей от костра»_",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-64,
			"y":5277,
			"width":520,
			"height":560
		},
		{
			"id":"7a48751bbaeb9ea6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **The path is blocked**\nConsequently, she unable to move without yaks of abandon her mother",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-784,
			"y":5315,
			"width":481,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"61b83a5730b48587",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **The missing father**\nThe father left for the monastery three days ago to get medicine for the mother (his wife) and has not returned. ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-783,
			"y":5507,
			"width":481,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"e3922e1835c79738",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Brands on yaks**\nThe nomad's cattle are marked with a special family brand that emits a glow.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-783,
			"y":5747,
			"width":481,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"a0ba555ce4a37ebc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **Bon script**\nShe can read the Bon script, having learned it from her father",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-784,
			"y":5955,
			"width":481,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"0705de505295ecc2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### Additional knowledge\nAncient spirits could move mountains, alter river courses, and direct the flows of winds.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-64,
			"y":6233,
			"width":520,
			"height":212
		},
		{
			"id":"d43806a4cf656321",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **NPC** \n#### ==**Lhamo**==\n\n---\n+ She’s a nomad with her family\n+ Accompanied by a herd of red-horned yaks\n+ Kind and considerate \n+ Wary of strangers \n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":-783,
			"y":4494,
			"width":480,
			"height":440
		},
		{
			"id":"27638e12dca8cb13",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **NPC** \n**Dolma**\n\n---\n+ An old woman\n+ Lives in Lopon Lama's house\n+ The last of her bloodline\n+ Her house sank into the rock\n+ A giant tree grows from the house.\n+ Bricked up inside the house\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null,
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":1576,
			"y":4478,
			"width":520,
			"height":480
		},
		{
			"id":"594a41dec2996718",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### **How to break the pact?** ",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null,
				"shape":"diamond",
				"textAlign":"center"
			},
			"x":3176,
			"y":4544,
			"width":360,
			"height":340
		},
		{
			"id":"df87a7938ec87fa1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **ACTION** \n\n> Burn the giant tree",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":3836,
			"y":4393,
			"width":520,
			"height":190
		},
		{
			"id":"01c0ea9124ec123c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **ACTION** \n\n> Give Lhamo her father’s brand\n\nLhamo decides to make a sacrifice",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":3836,
			"y":4863,
			"width":520,
			"height":190
		},
		{
			"id":"796b4fa70accc636",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **CONSEQUENCES** \n\n> 1. The path and bridge are free now\n> 2. **Dolma dies**\n> 3. Lhamo shares a Bon-script transcribe instruction she created for the protagonist\n\nIn the ACT II the protagonist meets a family with a newborn girl who is very curious about everything around her",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":4656,
			"y":4137,
			"width":520,
			"height":446
		},
		{
			"id":"bddc4d864d52778e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **CONSEQUENCES** \n\n> 1. The path and bridge are free now\n> 2. **Lhamo dies**\n> 3. Lhamo shares a Bon-script transcribe instruction she created for the protagonist\n\nПридумать последствия во втором акте",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":4656,
			"y":4863,
			"width":520,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"2a596216dc9ab48a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **NPC** \n**Tenzin**\n\n---\n+ He’s the Khenpo of the monastery\n+ His character is based on 14th Dalai Lama\n+ He’s concerned about the black roots\n+ He’s trying to repair the bridge \n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null,
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":696,
			"y":4514,
			"width":520,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"d9be31aa20eef88b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### Additional knowledge\nMysterious stones with unclear inscriptions that the hero cannot decipher",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1400,
			"y":6335,
			"width":481,
			"height":221
		},
		{
			"id":"c3b5b2ddf96e9eeb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **ACTION** \n\n> To copy the text of the pact and show it to Lhamo to transcribe it ",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":2416,
			"y":4619,
			"width":520,
			"height":190
		}
	],
